# Waefrebeorn Umbrella License v3.0 — Master License for All Waefrebeorn Work

## Preamble

**The populace is free. The corporation is an entity of money.**

We scale by definition to allow small businesses, governments, non-profits, and
educational entities to use freely — and to stop being taken advantage of by
mega-corporations.

This license is **agnostic and omnivorous**. It is the master license for ALL
Waefrebeorn projects across ALL media, repos, and platforms — **not just code,
not just models, not just MaaS**. It covers: source code and binaries, model
weights and fine-tunes, training data and datasets, video and audio, images
and art, comics and stories, documentation and research, hardware designs and
firmware, configs and scripts, and any future medium we invent.

It is broad, agnostic, and designed to maximize freedom for the general
population while ensuring that governments, entities, and large commercial
actors integrate responsibly.

We disassociate ourselves from malicious compliance and misuse. We cannot control
what every user does with our creations, because we are software creators, not
moral policemen. But we retain the right to deny our endorsement, cooperation,
and assistance to those who use our work for non-moral and non-allowable
activities. That is not a license restriction — it is a dispensation: we choose
not to be responsible for what we cannot control.

---

## Version

Waefrebeorn Umbrella License — Version 3.0
Effective: July 2026
Licensor: Waefrebeorn entity
SPDX-Identifier: Waefrebeorn-Umbrella-3.0

This version supersedes v1.0 and v2.0. Works received under an earlier version may continue under that version or be upgraded to v3.0 at the Licensee's option.

