The Licensor grants a patent license for any patent claims the Licensor can license that are necessarily infringed by the use, reproduction, and distribution of Waefrebeorn Work as permitted by this license. If a Licensee brings patent claims against Waefrebeorn Work or its users alleging infringement, all rights under this license terminate immediately (defensive patent termination, modeled on Apache 2.0 §3 and EPL 2.0).

