## 10. Governance and Versioning

This license may be updated over time through a publicly documented governance process. Future versions (v3.1, v4.0, etc.) may be published. Users may continue to use Waefrebeorn Work under their original version or upgrade to any newer version published by the Licensor.

The governance model is designed to be transparent and community-informed. Proposed changes to this license are published publicly and allow for community comment before adoption.

